Title:  Navigation

Seq:    1.8

Level:  3 - Topic

Class:  text

Body:

A reader can progress sequentially from front to back, can navigate to a
particular section or chapter using the table of contents, or can follow
hyperlinked references from one chapter to another.

Bibliographic references for quotations are linked to their respective
entries in the bibliography.

Various links are provided for albums, tracks and books.

